# /etc/velexis/healthcheck.env — OPTIONAL settings of the on-VM health check (velexis-healthcheck, task X-030;
# docs/mvp/deployment-single-vm.md §13). Owner root:root, mode 0600. velexis-healthcheck reads only the two names below,
# without sourcing the file; a missing file or a commented line means the default. Its alerts use alert.env.
#
# The storefront whose two payment pages the daily payment page check fetches through this VM's Caddy. It must be a
# storefront host Caddy has a certificate for: <key>.<STOREFRONT_BASE_DOMAIN> of an OTA that is provisioning, active
# or suspended, or a verified custom domain. Default: demo.<STOREFRONT_BASE_DOMAIN> of caddy.env.
# HEALTHCHECK_STOREFRONT_HOST=demo.ota.example.com
#
# The pages of storefront/payment-page-inventory.json that the daily check compares: payment (the default: the two
# payment pages of ADR-0011 §C) or all (every page of the inventory, as OADR-0017 point 8 asks).
# HEALTHCHECK_PAGES=payment
